<section>
<h2 id="discovery">Discovery</h2>
<p><p>
Episode 136 opens with David Friedberg acting as moderator because the usual moderator, Jason Calacanis, was on vacation and apparently insisted that the show must go on. Friedberg asks how JCal normally opens the show, which leads Chamath to start impersonating him. The bit ends with Chamath saying, “…shortest that's the fattest, and the fattest that's the dumbest,” and Friedberg reacting, “Oh, my god.”
</p>

<p>
Moments later, guest Brad Gerstner says the exact same thing. I only discovered Gerstner's reaction later, while watching the video during the Friedberg investigation. His line had left no trace in any transcript I had generated.
</p></p>
