<section>
<h2 id="triage-ruling-out-audio-failure">Triage: Ruling Out Audio Failure</h2>

<p>Before opening the decoder, I wanted to answer a much simpler question: <strong>is the missing speech actually represented in the audio?</strong> That sounds almost silly because I could hear it, but “I can hear a person talking” was not enough. I wanted to work from the beginning of the transcription stack and rule out the possibility that the signal was disappearing before Whisper ever had a meaningful chance to decode it.</p>

